{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOOSBALL HAS NEVER BEEN THIS FUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pimbolas is a local multiplayer party game where you can play fast-paced foosball matches in different arenas, using various power-ups to help you win and become a true champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621200/extras/10a603d5f9cc3151c49973b59a50bc9e.poster.avif?t=1760467793\" width=614 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621200/extras/10a603d5f9cc3151c49973b59a50bc9e.webm?t=1760467793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621200/extras/10a603d5f9cc3151c49973b59a50bc9e.mp4?t=1760467793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 15 different power-ups to spice up your matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various arenas to compete in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your players with different items and colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against the CPU as well</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621200/extras/f9d310df9fbbf8e09c97c33d6da870da.poster.avif?t=1760467793\" width=614 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621200/extras/f9d310df9fbbf8e09c97c33d6da870da.webm?t=1760467793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621200/extras/f9d310df9fbbf8e09c97c33d6da870da.mp4?t=1760467793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control of your foosball game! Pimbolas uses the analog sticks and triggers of your controller, allowing you to move, hit the ball, and spin to victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pimbolas is developed by <strong>Nano Knight Studio</strong>, an independent game studio dedicated to creating fun experiences for you to enjoy with your friends.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621200?t=1760467793","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621200/ad8fb810e6d8053546f7c31d1d4069139207fa06/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760467793","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621200/4d5d2183aacff67b91f2d3e7e99e6f06b6a38d9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760467793","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621200/4d5d2183aacff67b91f2d3e7e99e6f06b6a38d9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760467793","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOOSBALL HAS NEVER BEEN THIS FUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pimbolas is a local multiplayer party game where you c